# Ascend backend secrets — TEMPLATE.
# Copy this file to `secrets.properties` (which is git-ignored) and fill in the values
# from your Supabase project's API settings. Absent or empty is fine: the app builds and
# runs fully local-only with no backend, and Community features simply stay unavailable.
#
# The anon key is protected by Row Level Security and is not a true secret, but it is still
# never committed. NEVER put the Supabase service_role key here — it bypasses RLS and must
# only ever live server-side.

SUPABASE_URL=
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
